{
  "description": "DST transitions. Non-existent wall time (gap): instant = wall time - offset in effect BEFORE the transition (on the clock: shifted forward by the gap). Ambiguous wall time (overlap): the FIRST (earlier) instant. Keys always use the nominal local date/time. Europe/Berlin: CET +01 / CEST +02, 2026 switches 2026-03-29 01:00Z and 2026-10-25 01:00Z (2025: 2025-10-26 01:00Z). America/New_York: EST -05 / EDT -04, 2026-03-08 07:00Z, 2026-11-01 06:00Z (2025: 2025-11-02 06:00Z).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "dst_berlin_spring_gap_0230_daily",
      "description": "03-28 02:30 CET = 01:30Z; 03-29 02:30 does not exist -> 02:30 - (+01:00) = 01:30Z (03:30 CEST on the clock); 03-30 02:30 CEST = 00:30Z.",
      "schedule_id": "sched-t01",
      "rule": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "daily",
        "start_date": "2026-03-01",
        "times": [{"time": "02:30", "dose": {"amount": "1", "unit": "tablet"}}]
      },
      "tz": "Europe/Berlin",
      "window": {"from": "2026-03-28T00:00:00Z", "to": "2026-03-31T00:00:00Z"},
